<title>ESTONIA: NORMA CONSOLIDATED PROFIT 64.6 MLN EEK.</title>
<headline>NORMA CONSOLIDATED PROFIT 64.6 MLN EEK.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997, </p>
<p>					 (million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net consolidated profit	     64.6  vs 63.3</p>
<p> Turnover				  241.1  vs 406.7</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			   85.5   vs 85.9</p>
<p>NOTE -- Results for Norma automotive safety belt</p>
<p>manufacturer for the first half of 1997 compared to the total</p>
<p>for 1996.</p>
